{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>No Jumping. Just Flipping.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flipping Phantom</strong> is a 2D pixel-art puzzle platformer with a simple but powerful twist: <strong>you can\u2019t jump.</strong><br>As a cute little ghost, you <strong>phase into solid ground, fall through negative space, and reverse gravity</strong> to navigate each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/8efdc1662570aae44b35823e2453aee5.poster.avif?t=1770836187\" width=768 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/8efdc1662570aae44b35823e2453aee5.webm?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/8efdc1662570aae44b35823e2453aee5.mp4?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Lonely Little Ghost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The phantom is on a heartfelt mission to\u00a0<strong>reunite with their lost friends</strong> scattered across an eerie labyrinthine world.<br>Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter strange obstacles, hostile spirits, and otherworldly hazards that you must avoid to progress through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/e5578d416fd0d406de605e5af776e8a7.poster.avif?t=1770836187\" width=768 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/e5578d416fd0d406de605e5af776e8a7.webm?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/e5578d416fd0d406de605e5af776e8a7.mp4?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Gravity With Unique Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world introduces new mechanics and twists on your core abilities of flipping and floating. Once you master falling up, can you handle falling sideways?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/afd6029a15a658f57128e9d6713aaae9.poster.avif?t=1770836187\" width=768 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/afd6029a15a658f57128e9d6713aaae9.webm?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/afd6029a15a658f57128e9d6713aaae9.mp4?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Pumpkins and Unlock Levels..........</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level hides\u00a0<strong>collectible pumpkins </strong>for an extra challenge. Collect these spooky items to unlock <strong>additional levels and secret areas</strong>, giving completionists more incentive to explore and replay levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/07a56a66c89fe244d399533da23acfe5.poster.avif?t=1770836187\" width=768 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/07a56a66c89fe244d399533da23acfe5.webm?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/07a56a66c89fe244d399533da23acfe5.mp4?t=1770836187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for Every Player</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No in-game text</strong> \u2014 playable in every language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller and keyboard support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck compatible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, focused levels that respect your time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games that <strong>reward curiosity, pattern recognition, and spatial reasoning</strong>, <i>Flipping Phantom</i> will challenge and delight you with every twisted room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule art by Paul T-B</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866090?t=1770836187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/0cd2f74559ef1c3d0b587ce9f8ea7709ea196ca2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770836187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/a573e41bc155f05c0cc7f803efc0811bc735c6d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770836187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/a573e41bc155f05c0cc7f803efc0811bc735c6d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770836187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3887330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>No Jumping. Just Flipping.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flipping Phantom</strong> is a 2D pixel-art puzzle platformer with a simple but powerful twist: <strong>you can\u2019t jump.</strong><br>As a cute little ghost, you <strong>phase into solid ground, fall through negative space, an