ur time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games that <strong>reward curiosity, pattern recognition, and spatial reasoning</strong>, <i>Flipping Phantom</i> will challenge and delight you with every twisted room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule art by Paul T-B</p>","developers":["HonigBeeGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/516162c2d7e0120fcd762fb4cb67ce1d1e1d41eb/header.jpg?t=1770836187","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866090/124104695/d91b6f956c752656155ee0d6e4f628b08d2b30ee/1765234405/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765238499","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866090/124104695/d91b6f956c752656155ee0d6e4f628b08d2b30ee/1765234405/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765238499","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866090/124104695/d91b6f956c752656155ee0d6e4f628b08d2b30ee/1765234405/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765238499","id":257245433,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257245433/1dd8e5a2bb1f63e9ae7d9bcee87f5b68683d7508/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765238499"}],"name":"Flipping Phantom","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I3 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000+ or NVIDIA GT 710<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br